\strong{Algorithm.} The plant is first normalized with orthogonal
transformations of \code{z} and \code{w} and invertible scalings of \code{u} and \code{y}
so that \eqn{D_{12} = [0; I]} and \eqn{D_{21} = [0, I]} (these leave the
